sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as External Microservice / UI
    participant Middleware as RateLimiter Decorator
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant Router as Logs Router (/v1/logs)
    participant Service as LogService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB

    Client->>Middleware: POST /v1/logs (LogCreate payload)
    Middleware->>Redis: INCR rate:{ip}:/v1/logs
    Redis-->>Middleware: count
    alt Count > Limit (5 req/min)
        Middleware-->>Client: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests
    else Count <= Limit
        Middleware->>Router: Delegate to create_log()
        Router->>Service: create_log(log_data)
        Service->>DB: INSERT INTO logs (LogModel)
        DB-->>Service: Inserted record
        Service->>Redis: Forget stale keys (logs:stats, logs:trends, etc.)
        Service-->>Router: Log record object
        Router-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (LogResponse)
    end
